# env.optional — paid upgrade + tuning; the skill runs keyless without any of these.
# If APIFY_API_TOKEN is set -> the Apify residential-proxy transcript actor (more reliable
# from blocked cloud/datacenter IPs). If not set -> keyless YouTube timedtext path (default).
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Override the Apify transcript actor slug (default: pintostudio~youtube-transcript-scraper).
APIFY_YT_TRANSCRIPT_ACTOR
# --cache-dir uses the filesystem by default. For an external cache store, the agent may
# wrap the script with one of these (not consumed by the script itself):
# REDIS_URL
